    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like you're just saying what you're supposed to say. it doesn't change the fact that everything feels pointless. it just feels like the more i try to \"find a way through,\" the more i'm just hurting myself for no reason. if life is just constant suffering, isn't it more logical to just stop fighting it?",
